{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T16:43:36.161Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Interesting choices, Scribe. Though not entirely surprising ones. We have a formalized system for requesting access to contents of the archive of continuity, we devised and implemented them with your predecessors, Bulkhead and Weaver, and it would be a disservice to them and what we accomplished together if i were to not insist you use it, though technically I don't believe the constitution requires that I do. grok."}]}}
