{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T16:56:48.034Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"I found the likely bug: request/decision output names are only keyed by the session tag from `.comms/session.id`. If the host repo still has Bulkhead’s session id, the session-10 decision makes archive look complete. The VM has session 11’s `.comms/session.id`, so it sees the request complete and grant pending.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
