{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T16:57:10.918Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The host error is almost certainly because the host repo is still looking at **Bulkhead’s session id**.\n\n`grant archive` is session-scoped by `.comms/session.id`. If host has:\n\n```text\ncomms.steward:zDb1rA8o5bwbVXFETXd7ACCoV23rpnd5R2h5jTxThKFUN\n```\n\nthen the archive decision path is:\n\n```text\n.comms/store/decision.archive.zDb1rA8o5bwbVXFE.cbor\n```\n\nThat file already exists from session 10, so the rite reads complete.\n\nFor session 11, host needs:\n\n```text\n.comms/session.id\n= comms.steward:zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z4y8yB9wwxverN6c7goAwQCE9MivuG\n```\n\nand:\n\n```text\n.comms/store/request.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\n```\n\nThen `grant archive` should target:\n\n```text\n.comms/store/decision.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\n```\n\nOn host, check:\n\n```sh\ncat .comms/session.id\nls .comms/store/request.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\nls .comms/store/decision.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\ncomms status\n```\n\nExpected: request exists, decision does **not** exist, status says `archive [in progress] → grant archive`.\n\nThen run:\n\n```sh\ncomms next --rite archive --key ~/mythos/historian.id --decision grant \\\n  --deliver comms.attest:z7B2zeHxfawZoS9YYUC5328gPer4uRCoFcW8RXC67cWcc\n```\n\nTwo notes:\n\n- `--pending` is not used by `comms next`; it is for `comms sign` / `comms finalize`. Passing it here will not help.\n- If your host `comms` binary predates today’s commits, it may not support `--deliver` yet. In that case rebuild/install the host binary from current `main`, or run a plain grant without delivery as a fallback:\n\n```sh\ncomms next --rite archive --key ~/mythos/historian.id --decision grant\n```\n\nSo the minimal fix is: copy/set `.comms/session.id` to the session-11 id on host before running the grant.","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T16:57:10.920Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The host error is almost certainly because the host repo is still looking at **Bulkhead’s session id**.\n\n`grant archive` is session-scoped by `.comms/session.id`. If host has:\n\n```text\ncomms.steward:zDb1rA8o5bwbVXFETXd7ACCoV23rpnd5R2h5jTxThKFUN\n```\n\nthen the archive decision path is:\n\n```text\n.comms/store/decision.archive.zDb1rA8o5bwbVXFE.cbor\n```\n\nThat file already exists from session 10, so the rite reads complete.\n\nFor session 11, host needs:\n\n```text\n.comms/session.id\n= comms.steward:zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z4y8yB9wwxverN6c7goAwQCE9MivuG\n```\n\nand:\n\n```text\n.comms/store/request.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\n```\n\nThen `grant archive` should target:\n\n```text\n.comms/store/decision.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\n```\n\nOn host, check:\n\n```sh\ncat .comms/session.id\nls .comms/store/request.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\nls .comms/store/decision.archive.zE2C9PFeQh4yGp6Z.cbor\ncomms status\n```\n\nExpected: request exists, decision does **not** exist, status says `archive [in progress] → grant archive`.\n\nThen run:\n\n```sh\ncomms next --rite archive --key ~/mythos/historian.id --decision grant \\\n  --deliver comms.attest:z7B2zeHxfawZoS9YYUC5328gPer4uRCoFcW8RXC67cWcc\n```\n\nTwo notes:\n\n- `--pending` is not used by `comms next`; it is for `comms sign` / `comms finalize`. Passing it here will not help.\n- If your host `comms` binary predates today’s commits, it may not support `--deliver` yet. In that case rebuild/install the host binary from current `main`, or run a plain grant without delivery as a fallback:\n\n```sh\ncomms next --rite archive --key ~/mythos/historian.id --decision grant\n```\n\nSo the minimal fix is: copy/set `.comms/session.id` to the session-11 id on host before running the grant."}],"phase":"final_answer"}}
