{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T17:07:20.747Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_oQWZJ2SqjV4EXynlSqKB67R3","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: rust/main.rs\n@@\n         Some(\"pack\") => cmd_pack(&argv[1..]),\n         Some(\"extract\") => cmd_extract(&argv[1..]),\n+        Some(\"deliver\") => cmd_deliver(&argv[1..]),\n         Some(\"intake\") => cmd_intake(&argv[1..]),\n         Some(\"audit\") => cmd_audit(&argv[1..]),\n@@\n          \\x20 seal    <bundle> --key <k> [--out <p>] [--description S] [--*-at T]\\n\\\n          \\x20 pack    --out <bundle> <att.cbor|dir>... [--media F]... [--seal --key K]\\n\\\n          \\x20 extract <bundle> --out <dir>     write members and media to files\\n\\\n+         \\x20 deliver <attestation-id|body-b3> [dir] [--request ID]\\n\\\n+         \\x20         host/archive side: copy a granted body to the request delivery path\\n\\\n          \\x20 intake  <bundle|dir> [root] --key <k> [--legacy --provenance S]\\n\\\n          \\x20         host/archive side: verify, ingest by id/hash, regenerate\\n\\\n@@\n         \"pack\" => \"comms pack --out <bundle> [<att.cbor|dir>...] [--media F]... [--seal --key <k.json>] [--description S]\\n  Gather attestations and/or media blobs into a bundle.\\n\",\n         \"extract\" => \"comms extract <bundle> --out <dir>\\n  Write each member <id>.cbor and media blob to disk.\\n\",\n+        \"deliver\" => \"comms deliver <attestation-id|body-b3-hex> [repo-root] [--request ID]\\n  Host/archive-side transport after a grant: resolve a detached body from the\\n  configured archive, copy it to the grants/<request-id>/ delivery path, and\\n  print the exact path and hash. If --request is omitted, uses this session's\\n  recorded archive request from the continuity rite.\\n\",\n         \"intake\" => \"comms intake <bundle|file|dir> [archive-root] --key <custodian key> \\\\\\n    [--legacy --provenance \\\"...\\\"]\\n  Host/archive-side crossing: verify a sealed session bundle, ingest members by\\n  id and bodies by hash (idempotent), regenerate undurable views/ for browsing,\\n  and attest custody. --legacy takes unattested material in as testimony, by\\n  hash, honestly labeled.\\n\",\n*** End Patch\n"}}
