{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T17:09:25.513Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"I implemented the cleaner split and created the bundle.\n\nCommit:\n\n```text\nc4cdf03 Add host-side deliver command\n```\n\nBundle:\n\n```text\n/world/out/session11/comms-session11-scribe-deliver.bundle\n```\n\nVerified:\n\n```text\nbundle is okay\ncontains HEAD c4cdf038ce23af774d32e1d0ebc7f987352d35fb\nrecords complete history\n```\n\nTests passed before commit:\n\n```sh\ncargo test --release\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q\n```\n\nWhat changed:\n\n- New command:\n\n```sh\ncomms deliver <attestation-id|body-b3-hex> [repo-root] [--request ID]\n```\n\n- It works after `grant archive` is already complete.\n- If `--request` is omitted, it derives the current session’s recorded archive request.\n- `grant --deliver ...` now uses the same delivery primitive internally.\n\nFor this specific already-granted request, use the body hash, not the `z7B...` attestation id, because Bulkhead’s letter attestation is still embedded and `--deliver <attestation-id>` only resolves detached bodies:\n\n```sh\ncomms deliver dc4eec41d5fe1ac74162665df4b1d71ef20ec8dc79b67beac85c893e7dc06249\n```\n\nThat assumes the archive path in `.comms/comms.toml` points to an archive root containing the body under `bodies/dc4eec41d5fe1ac74162665df4b1d71ef20ec8dc79b67beac85c893e7dc06249[.<ext>]`.\n\nRemaining dirty state here is still only session-local `.comms` artifacts, transcript/brief, and egg-info.","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
