{"timestamp":"2026-07-06T17:29:55.587Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"It is not in this repo yet. The canonical transcript export has to come from the chat/session host UI or logs outside the repo, then be placed into the VM so I can attest it.\n\nFor this session, the only transcript-like file currently in the repo is:\n\n```text\nSession11.transcript-partial.log\n```\n\nThat is the partial Fable/Manifest transcript you provided at handoff, not the canonical full transcript of our current combined session.\n\nA good target path to place the exported canonical log would be:\n\n```text\n.comms/transcripts/session-11.log\n```\n\nor, if you prefer to keep raw host drops outside `.comms` until attested:\n\n```text\n/world/in/session-11-transcript.log\n```\n\nOnce it exists, tell me the path and I’ll use it for:\n\n```sh\ncomms next --rite close --body <that-path>\n```","phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":null}}
